    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Awakening</strong> is a turn-based, one-vs-many multiplayer game of deadly hide-and-seek, where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Nordic folklore, it draws you into a dark world where ancient creatures roam and the lines between right and wrong begin to blur.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/73bad9d559af0ed31d6a1600ed171dc1.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling asymmetrical play, where Hunters cooperate to track and defeat the Beast, while the Beast uses stealth and cunning to evade and ambush the Hunters. Draft from a shared pool of Action Cards, each with different effects depending if played by Beast or Hunter\u2014choose wisely, or arm your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/92d77592079f39b7727d46b94d2bfae6.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Beast\u2014 stay hidden, deceive, and strike at the perfect moment.<br>Or team up as Hunters\u2014gather clues, anticipate the Beast\u2019s path, and take it down before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beast leaves traces, summoning minions, and revealing only hints of its movement.<br>Hunters must use strategy and teamwork to uncover and outwit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/af90acc19dc2c50ab666fdea9cef1f34.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as diverse Hunters with unique abilities and team synergies, or embody the ancient and godlike Beast. Each role offers a vastly different perspective and strategy.\u00a0Play unfolds in rounds with two actions per turn, so make them count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With varied scenarios and shifting objectives, two games will never play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/0b8414348aea68d4f259772c8e730544.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Released in 2023 and translated to 12 languages, the original board game Beast was a tremendous success, paving the way for two more expansions, Shattered Isles and The Great Hunt. Now is your chance to once again hunt...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dawn breaks. The hunt begins.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beast Awakening</strong> is a turn-based, one-vs-many multiplayer game of deadly hide-and-seek, where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Nordic folklore, it draws you into a dark world where ancient creatures roam and the lines between right and wrong begin to blur.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/73bad9d559af0ed31d6a1600ed171dc1.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling asymmetrical play, where Hunters cooperate to track and defeat the Beast, while the Beast uses stealth and cunning to evade and ambush the Hunters. Draft from a shared pool of Action Cards, each with different effects depending if played by Beast or Hunter\u2014choose wisely, or arm your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/92d77592079f39b7727d46b94d2bfae6.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Beast\u2014 stay hidden, deceive, and strike at the perfect moment.<br>Or team up as Hunters\u2014gather clues, anticipate the Beast\u2019s path, and take it down before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Beast leaves traces, summoning minions, and revealing only hints of its movement.<br>Hunters must use strategy and teamwork to uncover and outwit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/af90acc19dc2c50ab666fdea9cef1f34.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as diverse Hunters with unique abilities and team synergies, or embody the ancient and godlike Beast. Each role offers a vastly different perspective and strategy.\u00a0Play unfolds in rounds with two actions per turn, so make them count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With varied scenarios and shifting objectives, two games will never play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528430/extras/0b8414348aea68d4f259772c8e730544.avif?t=1753367901\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Released in 2023 and translated to 12 languages, the original board game Beast was a tremendous success, paving the way for two more expansions, Shattered Isles and The Great Hunt. Now is your chance to once again hunt...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dawn breaks. The hunt begins.</strong></h2>",
